    "description": "Welcome to 3960 20th Street, a stunning Craftsman-style home nestled on a quiet block in the highly desirable Dolores Heights neighborhood. Step into an open, sunlit floor plan where coffered ceilings, hardwood floors, and expansive windows showcase the home's thoughtful craftsmanship. The living area flows seamlessly from a formal living room anchored by a charming fireplace to a family room lined with windows and French doors that open to the balcony. The chef's kitchen is a true showpiece, featuring a large island, professional-grade stainless steel appliances, and skylights that bathe the space in natural light. This recently updated home offers 3 bedrooms & 2 baths all on one level. The primary suite provides garden views, ample closet space, and an en suite bath complete with a double vanity and walk-in shower. Step outside to your serene backyard with large brick patio and multiple seating areas framed by mature trees and greenery. Accessible from all three levels, the backyard is perfect for hosting or simply unwinding in peace. Additionally, enjoy two-car parking and close proximity to Dolores Park, Noe Valley, and the Mission's dining and shopping. With iconic San Francisco views, and a location blending tranquility with city convenience, this home is not to be missed!"
  },
